<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi all<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This is the Fullpass Test Report for Yocto 1.2 M4 RC2 bui=
ld. There are totally 46 bugs found in this testing, with 9 new bugs report=
ed. All M4 testable features in 1.2 are covered in M4 RC2 testing, includin=
g
 yocto-bsp/kernel, multilib, Hob, etc. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">BS=
P and QEMU targets work well without major issue. The only 2 new issues on =
BSPs are connman-property launch failure and and Glib-Gobject-warning, no l=
ogin via serial console on beagleboard.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Fo=
r Hob testing against poky/master branch with commint 190f6d791d51aaa4cfb9f=
1cf932bc205ff674fb5, there are 3 new bugs reported. Most functions could wo=
rk well in Hob, hob-toochain may build
 pass but it depends on image profile. Inconformity recipes when change mac=
hine; uses can=A1=AFt remove meta-yocto layer.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Fo=
r Core build system, there are 1 new bugs reported, Archive source failed w=
hen build image. Other issues like disk monitor and image build with PAM co=
uld not work, Multilib build appliance
 could not work at all.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Fo=
r ADT, except for Clutter template creation, most functions could work well=
 and glxgears can work well on most host machine. A new minor issue is repo=
rted for ADT installer with ppc kernel.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;F=
or distribution testing, N&#43;1 testing is performed against CentOS/Ubuntu=
/Opensuse/Fedora. Two new bugs are CentOS 5.6 x86 failed to compile gdb and=
 Fedora 17 alpha x86-64 failed to compile mklibs-native.<o:p></o:p></span><=
/p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Fo=
r build performance, o</span><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.0pt=
;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">ne qemux86 sato buil=
d on a Core i7 machine costs 112 minutes, which saves 13.8% time
 than the result in 1.2 M4 RC1 build(130 minutes)</span><span lang=3D"EN-US=
"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;N=
ote: The test report is archived @ <a href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org=
/wiki/Yocto_1.2_Milestone_Test_Report">
https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.2_Milestone_Test_Report</a>.<o:p=
></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
